OpenBSD patch for patch-store-dup.

$OpenBSD$

GHC 9.10 requires DuplicateRecordFields pragma when exporting
record fields with the same name from different data types.
GroupLinkInfo and StoreError both have a 'groupId' field.

--- src/Simplex/Chat/Store.hs.orig
+++ src/Simplex/Chat/Store.hs
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 {-# LANGUAGE CPP #-}
+{-# LANGUAGE DuplicateRecordFields #-}

 module Simplex.Chat.Store
   ( DBStore,
